# Exclude everything from the build context...
*

# ...except the prebuilt genver binaries GoReleaser stages under <os>/<arch>/,
# which the Dockerfiles COPY in. Re-including the directories is required before
# the files inside them can be un-ignored.
!linux
!linux/amd64
!linux/arm64
!linux/amd64/genver
!linux/arm64/genver
